Welcome to this week's Top 7, where the DEV editorial team handpicks their favorite posts from the previous week. Congrats to all the authors that made it onto the list 👏 Mean Time to Understanding 🤔: The Irreducible Human Element in the Age of Infinite Code 🤖. GrahamTheDev ・ Dec 21 #ai #webdev #programming
@grahamthedev explores the concept of "Mean Time to Understanding" as a critical metric in an era flooded with AI-generated code. They argue that while code generation speeds up, the true bottleneck remains the human capacity to comprehend and maintain complex systems. Technical Debt Is a Myth Created By Bad Managers Adam - The Developer ・ Dec 23 #productivity #management #webdev #software
